<http://data.silknow.org/object/5b5af472-f6e5-3603-9cf5-b4ef699afbe3/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "A woman's shift of linen, with a 3/4 inch band around the neckline and short, ungathered sleeves.  The shift is cut in one piece with diagonal shaping at the sides.  The sleeves are of a slightly coarser weave than the body.  There are three groups of three tiny buttonhole stitches embroidered in pink silk thread at the centre front edge of the neck band."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/5b5af472-f6e5-3603-9cf5-b4ef699afbe3> .

